  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supportive: NEP Review of Internal Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Supportive: NEP Review of Internal Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Sveriges ambassad i Kigali planerar att ge st&#xf6;d till implementeringen av National Employment Program (NEP).  Insatsen syftar till att genomf&#xf6;ra en granskning av NEPs interna styrning och kontroll f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra projektets kapacitet att leverera resultat samt att minska risk med att kanalisera finansiering via NEP. NEP &#xe4;r f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rvarande i uppstartsskede och granskningen kommer att bidra till att NEP strukturen riggas r&#xe4;tt fr&#xe5;n b&#xf6;rjan. En upphandling av konsult under Sidas ramavtal f&#xf6;r finansiell revision utan bestyrkande kommer att ske.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden is considering support to Rwanda&apos;s National Employment Program (NEP). As a precondition for such support, the internal management    and control of the program will need to be reviewed in order to get   reasonable assurance of the functioning of the system, as well as to  get a plan of action for strengthening the system during              implementation in cooperation with the implementing Ministry.</narrative>
  </description>
